; The program of the first run of the suite fatlfn of test/fat_runs.py:
; long names of 13 and 26 characters, which fill one and two long-name
; entries with no 0 after them, written and read back. The format is
; test/fat_tool.py's, OPS.

seg
open 0, "thirteen.ch13", 1      ; 0: THIRTE~1.CH1 and one long-name entry
close 0
open 0, "twentysix_characters.ch_26", 1     ; 0: TWENTY~1.CH_ and two
close 0
open 0, "THIRTEEN.CH13", 0      ; 0, by the long name in another case
close 0
open 0, "Twentysix_Characters.CH_26", 0     ; 0
close 0
open 1, "", 2
readname 1                      ; HELLO.BIN
readname 1                      ; thirteen.ch13
readname 1                      ; twentysix_characters.ch_26
readname 1                      ; 0, the end
close 1
